  "text": "Stop getting pinged with urgent Slack notifications while solving complex problems on remote teams. Nothing derails high-value execution faster than bright red badges popping up during critical coding sessions. Glancing at one message triggers context switching that burns twenty minutes before you refocus. Sync Reclaim with Google Calendar to automatically mute Slack, auto-decline conflicts, and post return times. This defends your mornings for deep uninterrupted output.",
